{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tabletop sandbox casual mini-game, while playing entertainment, we should also pay attention to traffic safety. Just control the A/D button to avoid oncoming traffic, and add 1 point for each successful dodge of a car. There is no time and integral cap, the operation is very simple, focus on not colliding with any objects, once any collision occurs, the game is over. Of course, luck is also part of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mode of operation: mouse and keyboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Moving graphics: A/D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suspension: ESC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Toggle Full Screen/Window: F11</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">End Conditions: 1. Any collision occurs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Click on the &quot;X&quot; button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3.ALT F4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PS: Please don't drive in the opposite direction, safety first!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649440?t=1745492354","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649440?t=1745492354","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649440/2b64bd15dfe6931efab7ffcc9b64e2f9ee0867cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745492354","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649440/2b64bd15dfe6931efab7ffcc9b64e2f9ee0867cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745492354","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tabletop sandbox casual mini-game, while playing entertainment, we should also pay attention to traffic safety. Just control the A/D button to avoid oncoming traffic, and add 1 point for each successful dodge of a car. There is no time and integral cap, the operation is very simple, focus on not colliding wi